 - ✅ **Partitions:** SMEM-defined → `qcom,smem-part` auto-reads DEVCFG/APPSBLENV/APPSBL/cert/ART/rootfs.
@@ -104,7 +104,7 @@ derived from `ipq8071-ap8220` (the closest in-tree 2.5G IPQ8072 AP).
   driver** — not portable.
